# ACID (the zicCycle 303) is the starting project's track 5: its pages show
tapkey b5
expect trk 5
tap SEL
expect view 6
expect eng 25
tap EDIT
shot acid_edit.png
tap ENV
shot acid_env.png
tap FX
shot acid_fx.png
# and it plays on the track (the ACID line of the starter project)
tap SEQ
wav acid.wav
tap PLAY
wait 3000
wavstop
